I asked ChatGPT to assist me with organizing and checking the code for any errors or accuracy issues, in which the AI assistance helped me with a few unspotted syntax errors and spelling errors that I had done throughout implementation of this code. I also used ChatGPT to assist with organizing my README file as well, which wasn't as helpful and required me to think about which sections and information I should revise and adjust throughout this file. One thing that the AI bot didn't do well on was grabbing the full functionality of the code that I included inside the prompt, along with adding extra information that wasn't necessary throughout the command description.
